<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#Sx1.SS1" title="In Appendix ‣ What Makes a Good Generated Image? Investigating Human and Multimodal LLM Image Preference Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">8.1 </span>Human-Rated Dataset Creation and Generation Settings</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#Sx1.SS2" title="In Appendix ‣ What Makes a Good Generated Image? Investigating Human and Multimodal LLM Image Preference Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">8.2 </span>Task Definition and Reduction of Ambiguity</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#Sx1.SS3" title="In Appendix ‣ What Makes a Good Generated Image? Investigating Human and Multimodal LLM Image Preference Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">8.3 </span>Sample Dataset Images</span></a></li>
