<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Cohen’s Kappa agreement between human and LLM ratings across different aspects (sorted by Overall).</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="S4.T2" class="ltx_table">
<table id="S4.T2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S4.T2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S4.T2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:-1pt;padding-bottom:-1pt;">Model</th>
